# Wave T38 (Driftlog kit): coraldoor — the CORAL DOOR face: coral-red planks (#a34d3f, the town style table's own door colour) in a dark timber frame, iron studs, a rope-ring handle, one step stone at the foot. Swapped onto the three boat-houses' shipped facade-panel cells — kind only; the cells stay walkable exactly as facade-panel ships. The painting gives every Driftlog house a coral door. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T38-DRIFTLOG-PLAN.md §5.)
